  "description": "AI-powered robotic platform for natural orifice endourology, initially targeting Holmium Laser Enucleation of the Prostate (HoLEP / RoLEP). The platform utilizes a 7-axis KUKA LBR Med collaborative robotic arm mounted on a mobile cart with touch tablet navigation, paired with proprietary AI computer vision for real-time spatial navigation and anatomical guidance to streamline transurethral laser surgeries.",
